eployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#prerequisites","content":"A default `StorageClass` for master/worker PVCs","locale":"en"},"1325":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-30","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#architecture","content":"Helm release `curvine` is deployed in namespace `curvine`:","locale":"en"},"1326":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-31","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#architecture","content":"| Resource                     | Description               |\n| ---------------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| StatefulSet `curvine-master` | Metadata and Raft journal |","locale":"en","table":"table-0"},"1327":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-32","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#architecture","content":"| Resource                     | Description |\n| ---------------------------- | ----------- |\n| StatefulSet `curvine-worker` | Data nodes  |","locale":"en","table":"table-0"},"1328":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-33","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#architecture","content":"| Resource                 | Description        |\n| ------------------------ | ------------------ |\n| Service `curvine-master` | Headless, RPC 8995 |","locale":"en","table":"table-0"},"1329":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-34","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#architecture","content":"| Resource                 | Description        |\n| ------------------------ | ------------------ |\n| Service `curvine-worker` | Headless, RPC 8997 |","locale":"en","table":"table-0"},"1330":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-35","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#architecture","content":"| Resource                      | Description                                      |\n| ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| Deployment `curvine-transfer` | Load / Export service, created only when enabled |","locale":"en","table":"table-0"},"1331":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-36","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#architecture","content":"| Resource                   | Description                                                       |\n| -------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Service `curvine-transfer` | Internal Transfer RPC and web endpoint, created only when enabled |","locale":"en","table":"table-0"},"1332":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-37","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#architecture","content":"`openKruise.enabled` defaults to `false`. StatefulSets use `apps/v1`.","locale":"en"},"1333":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-38","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#transfer-service","content":"Transfer is an optional service for independent Load and Export scheduling. The\nchart creates the `curvine-transfer` Deployment and Service only when\n`transfer.enabled=true`; before that, the Master exposes the legacy Load API.\nEnabling Transfer does not require changing Master or Worker configuration. To\ndeploy Transfer outside the chart, see\nDeploy Transfer on Kubernetes.","locale":"en"},"1334":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-39","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#enable-transfer","content":"Use a Curvine image release that contains the Transfer binary. Do not use an\nolder chart image tag just because the chart itself supports the values below.\nFor high availability or more than one Transfer replica, MySQL must be reachable\nbefore the Transfer Pod starts:","locale":"en"},"1335":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-40","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#enable-transfer","content":"The chart creates `curvine-transfer` as an internal `ClusterIP` Service and\nwrites its Service FQDN to `[transfer].hostname`. Curvine infers the RPC\nendpoint from that hostname and `transfer.rpcPort`; do not configure\n`endpoints` in normal Helm deployments.","locale":"en"},"1336":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-41","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#enable-transfer","content":"An empty `transfer.storeUrl` uses the single-Pod SQLite default. The chart\ncreates a `ReadWriteOnce` PVC for its data directory without setting\n`storageClassName`, so Kubernetes uses the default StorageClass. The PVC\npersists across Pod replacement. MySQL is mandatory when\n`transfer.replicas > 1` and recommended for high availability.","locale":"en"},"1337":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-42","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#enable-transfer","content":"For SQLite, the Transfer Deployment uses `Recreate` so the old Pod detaches its\n`ReadWriteOnce` volume before a replacement starts. Helm retains the SQLite PVC\non uninstall; delete it explicitly only when discarding Transfer metadata.","locale":"en"},"1338":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-43","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#enable-transfer","content":"The generated ConfigMap is used by Master, Worker, and Transfer. External CLI\nhosts must also use a cluster config with `[transfer] enabled = true`; the CLI\ncommands remain `cv load`, `cv export`, `cv load-status`, and\n`cv cancel-load`.","locale":"en"},"1339":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-44","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#verify","content":"Web UI:","locale":"en"},"1340":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-45","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#master-addresses","content":"Single replica:","locale":"en"},"1341":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-46","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#master-addresses","content":"Three replicas:","locale":"en"},"1342":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-47","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#upgrade","content":"`master.replicas` cannot be changed after install.","locale":"en"},"1343":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-48","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#troubleshooting","content":"| Symptom     | Command                                  | Cause                                   |\n| ----------- | ---------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| Pod Pending | `kubectl describe pod -n curvine <name>` | Insufficient resources; no StorageClass |","locale":"en","table":"table-1"},"1344":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-49","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#troubleshooting","content":"| Symptom             | Command                                    | Cause                   |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------ | ----------------------- |\n| Slow master startup | `kubectl logs curvine-master-0 -n curvine` | Raft replay in progress |","locale":"en","table":"table-1"},"1345":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-50","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#troubleshooting","content":"| Symptom     | Command          | Cause                     |\n| ----------- | ---------------- | ------------------------- |\n| PVC Pending | `kubectl get sc` | No available StorageClass |","locale":"en","table":"table-1"},"1346":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-51","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#configuration-reference","content":"Chart version `0.5.2-alpha`. Defaults below match `helm show values curvine/curvine --version 0.5.2-alpha`.","locale":"en"},"1347":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-52","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#global","content":"| Parameter              | Default         | Description               |\n| ---------------------- | --------------- | ------------------------- |\n| `global.clusterDomain` | `cluster.local` | Kubernetes cluster domain |","locale":"en","table":"table-2"},"1348":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-53","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#cluster","content":"| Parameter   