s","content":"Based on this reference, you can extrapolate other hardware resource requirements from one resource value.\nFor example, if you have 2 SSD disks, you would need 4 CPU cores, 8GB memory, and 20Gbps bandwidth. 4GB memory is also acceptable, depending on business concurrency - if concurrency is not high, memory doesn't need to be increased.","locale":"en"},"1531":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup-18","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup#resource-requirements","content":"This is for reference only. Actual requirements depend on your specific business needs.","locale":"en"},"1532":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup-19","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup#create-installation-package","content":"Compile and package the software. For compilation steps, see Download and Compile Curvine.","locale":"en"},"1533":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup-20","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup#create-installation-package","content":"From the project root, run:","locale":"en"},"1534":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup-21","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup#create-installation-package","content":"This runs `make all` (if needed), then packages the contents of `build/dist` into a tar.gz file. The archive is created in the **project root** with a name like `curvine-<platform>-<arch>-<timestamp>.tar.gz`, or `curvine-<version>-<platform>-<arch>.tar.gz` if you set `RELEASE_VERSION` (e.g. `RELEASE_VERSION=v1.0.0 make dist`). This archive is the Curvine installation package for deployment or for building runtime images.","locale":"en"},"1535":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup-22","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup#environment-script-and-main-config","content":"After unpacking the installation package, the key files are:","locale":"en"},"1536":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup-23","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup#environment-script-and-main-config","content":"`conf/curvine-env.sh`: shell-side environment setup","locale":"en"},"1537":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup-24","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup#environment-script-and-main-config","content":"`conf/curvine-cluster.toml`: main cluster configuration","locale":"en"},"1538":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup-25","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup#environment-script-and-main-config","content":"The environment script exports these important variables:","locale":"en"},"1539":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup-26","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-set