","content":"| Command                                      | Description                       |\n| -------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| `cv fs blocks <PATH> [--format table\\|json]` | Show file block location details. |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"2806":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-76","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs-file-system-operations","content":"| Command                               | Description                                      |\n| ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| `cv fs free <PATH> [-r\\|--recursive]` | Release Curvine cache space for UFS-synced data. |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"2807":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-77","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs-file-system-operations","content":"Common examples:","locale":"en"},"2808":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-78","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs-file-system-operations","content":"`cv fs ls` also supports HDFS-style listing flags:","locale":"en"},"2809":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-79","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs-file-system-operations","content":"| Option            | Description       |\n| ----------------- | ----------------- |\n| `-C, --path-only` | Print paths only. |","locale":"en","table":"table-5"},"2810":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-80","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs-file-system-operations","content":"| Option            | Description                      |\n| ----------------- | ----------------------