stdout 输出严格 JSON，格式遵循 Fluid 的 ReportSummary 输出要求：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3428":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-68","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-创建-cacheruntimeclass","content":"Curvine 只上报 master 能低成本返回的值：已缓存字节数、缓存容量和文件数。`ufsTotal`、`cachedPercentage`、`cacheHitRatio` 暂时保持为 `0`，直到 Curvine 有权威的 UFS 总量和命中率元数据。这样可以避免把“缓存容量使用率”误写成“Dataset 缓存百分比”。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3429":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-69","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#2-创建-dataset-和-cacheruntime","content":"从这个文件开始：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3430":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-70","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#2-创建-dataset-和-cacheruntime","content":"应用：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3431":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-71","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#2-创建-dataset-和-cacheruntime","content":"示例文件同时包含两个资源：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3432":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-72","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#2-创建-dataset-和-cacheruntime","content":"`Dataset.spec.mounts[].mountPoint` 是 Curvine 通过 Fluid 暴露的后端路径。业务 Pod 后续挂载的是 Dataset 生成的 PVC，不需要直接挂这个后端路径。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3433":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-73","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#3-等待运行时就绪","content":"检查 Fluid 资源和 Curvine Pod：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3434":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-74","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"t