hitecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"在已有 `CacheRuntimeClass` 顶层增加 `dataOperationSpecs`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3454":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-94","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"只需要增加这个字段。不要为了打开 DataLoad 去改 `topology`、`fileSystemType` 或 master/worker/client 定义。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3455":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-95","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"不要把这段直接当成完整生产命令复制使用，除非你的 DataLoad 镜像或脚本会在执行 `cv load` 前生成 `/etc/curvine.toml`。Curvine 示例 `curvine-docker/fluid/cache-runtime/curvine-cache-runtime-class.yaml` 已经包含这部分逻辑。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3456":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-96","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"Fluid 会把这些环境变量注入 DataLoad Job：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3457":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-97","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"| 环境变量                      | 含义       |\n| ------------------------- | -------- |\n| `FLUID_DATALOAD_METADATA` | 是否加载元数据。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"3458":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-98","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"| 环境变量                       | 含义                   |\n| -------------------------- | -------------------- |\n| `FLUID_DATALOAD_DATA_PATH` | 要加载的路径，多个路径用 `:` 连接。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"3459":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-99","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"| 环境变量                           | 含义                    |\n| ------------------------------ | --------------------- |\n| `FLUID_DATALOAD_PATH_REPLICAS` | 每个路径的副本数，多个值用 `:` 连接。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"3460":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-100","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"Curvine 的 CacheRuntimeClass 示例会在 `dataOperationSpecs` 里内联 DataLoad 脚本，因为 Fluid 会把数据操作作为短生命周期 Job 执行。脚本会先从 Fluid runtime JSON 生成 Curvine 配置；如果这个文件没有挂载，再依次回退到 Dataset 元数据、Pod label，以及 `<dataset>-load` 这类 DataLoad 名称规则。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3461":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-101","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"当 Fluid 传入 `/minio` 这样的 Dataset 内路径时，脚本会读取 Curvine mount 元数据，把它解析成真正需要加载的 Curvine source，再执行 `cv load --watch`。这样 DataLoad 和 `mountUFS` 的语义是一致的。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3462":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-102","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#2-创建-dataload-资源","content":"示例：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3463":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-103","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#2-创建-dataload-资源","content":"应用：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3464":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-104","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#2-创建-dataload-资源","content":"`spec.dataset` 指定 Dataset。`spec.target[].path` 指定要预热的 Dataset 内路径。Fluid 会把这些路径通过 `FLUID_DATALOAD_DATA_PATH` 传给 Job。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3465":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-105","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#3-检查-dataload-job","content":"只有每个目标路径的 `cv load --watch` 都成功退出，DataLoad 才算成功。如果 `cv load --watch` 返回错误，Job 应该失败，这样 Fluid 才能把问题暴露出来。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3466":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-106","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#关于-etcfluidconfigruntimejson","content":"Fluid chart `helm-chart-fluid-1.1.0-alpha.10` 会把 runtime config 文件挂载进 CacheRuntime DataLoad Pod，并设置 `FLUID_RUNTIME_CONFIG_PATH`。使用这个版本时，Curvine DataLoad 可以像 master、worker、client Pod 一样生成配置。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3467":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-107","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#关于-etcfluidconfigruntimejson","content":"更旧的 Fluid 版本或自定义 DataLoad 模板，可能只设置了 `FLUID_RUNTIME_CONFIG_PATH`，但没有把 runtime config 文件挂载进 DataLoad Pod。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3468":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-108","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#关于-etcfluidconfigruntimejson","content":"如果你的 DataLoad 命令需要读取 runtime JSON，请同时确认两件事：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3469":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-109","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#关于-etcfluidconfigruntimejson","content":"DataLoad Pod 中设置了 `FLUID_RUNTIME_CONFIG_PATH`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3470":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-110","