ion-12","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#oss-配置","content":"OSS 配置","locale":"zh-cn"},"3625":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-13","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#hdfs-配置","content":"HDFS 配置","locale":"zh-cn"},"3626":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-14","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#hdfs-环境要求","content":"HDFS 环境要求","locale":"zh-cn"},"3627":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-15","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#编译要求","content":"编译要求","locale":"zh-cn"},"3628":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-16","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#运行环境要求","content":"运行环境要求","locale":"zh-cn"},"3629":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-17","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#概述","content":"Curvine 在核心层面集成了 OpenDAL（Open Data Access Layer，开放数据访问层），为 Curvine 提供强大的存储生态支持。这种集成使得 Curvine 能够与各种存储后端无缝协作，同时保持统一的接口。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3630":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-18","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#什么是-opendal","content":"OpenDAL 是一个数据访问层，提供统一的 API 来访问各种存储服务。它作为应用程序和存储系统之间的抽象层，提供：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3631":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-19","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal