PVC。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5825":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-17","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#实际行为","content":"每个 Pod 会把自己的主机名、时间戳和 PVC 名称写入 `index.html`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5826":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-18","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#实际行为","content":"CSI Controller 会为每个 PVC 动态创建对应的 Curvine 目录。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5827":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-19","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#实际行为","content":"CSI Node Plugin 再把对应目录挂载到对应的 Pod 中。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5828":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-20","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#实际行为","content":"因此，虽然这些副本共用同一个 CSI 驱动和同一个 `StorageClass`，但应用层看到的是彼此独立的数据目录。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5829":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-21","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#校验-pvc-隔离","content":"查看每个副本写出的内容：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5830":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-22","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#校验-pvc-隔离","content":"输出里应该能看到不同的主机名和 PVC 名称。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5831":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-23","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#校验持久性","content":"如果 Pod 重建后仍能看到 `retained`，说明 StatefulSet 已正确复用原来的 PVC。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5832":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-24","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#说明","content":"示例中的 `volumeClaimTemplates` 使用 `ReadWriteOnce`，这符合 StatefulSet 常见的一副本一写者模式。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5833":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-25","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#说明","content":"动态创建的 Curvine 目录仍然是由 StorageClass 的 `fs-path` 加 PV 名称组合出来的，而不是直接用 Pod 序号命名。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5834":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-26","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#说明","content":"FUSE 复用仍然发生在节点层面，键是 `master-addrs + fs-path`；Pod 间数据隔离来自各自 PVC 指向的不同子目录。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5835":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver","type":"page","content":"K8S CSI Driver","breadcrumbs":["Documents","用户手册","K8S CSI 驱动"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver","locale":"zh-cn"},"5836":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","type":"page","content":"缓存","breadcrumbs":["Documents","用户手册","核心特征"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","locale":"zh-cn"},"5837":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-0","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#一什么是-curvine","content":"一、什么是 Curvine？","locale":"zh-cn"},"5838":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-1","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","type":"heading","tags":[],"url