,"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-什么是-fuse","content":"FUSE 全称 Filesystem in Userspace，即用户态文件系统，是 Linux 内核提供的通用机制，最大优势是把分布式/自定义存储，变成和本地磁盘一样的操作体验。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5950":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-16","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#2-fuse-对-curvine-的核心作用","content":"FUSE 是 Curvine 最主要、最通用的 API 入口，也是接入最简单的方式：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5951":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-17","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#2-fuse-对-curvine-的核心作用","content":"零改造使用：用户无需修改业务代码、不用额外适配，像操作本地 C 盘、D 盘一样，通过系统自带的文件命令（`ls`、`cat`、`vim`、`git` 等）操作 Curvine 存储","locale":"zh-cn"},"5952":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-18","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#2-fuse-对-curvine-的核心作用","content":"高性能根基：Curvine 基于 Rust 语言，对 FUSE 做了完全异步重构，且仅依赖内核原生 FUSE 模块，没有额外冗余依赖，这是它支持高并发、高性能的核心底层保障","locale":"zh-cn"},"5953":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-19","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-常规分布式存储close-to-open-语义","content":"大部分分布式存储默认遵循 Close-to-Open：文件写入后，必须执行 close 关闭操作，写入的数据才会对其他客户端可见，中途写入的内容不会暴露。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5954":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-20","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#2-curvine-一致性flush-即可见","content":"Curvine 不遵循 Close-to-Open，而是和本地磁盘文件语义完全一致：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5955":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-21","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#2-curvine-一致性flush-即可见","content":"核心规则：数据只要执行 flush（刷新到存储），就立刻对所有客户端可见，无需等待 close 关闭文件","locale":"zh-cn"},"5956":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-22","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#2-curvine-一致性flush-即可见","content":"核心价值：这是 Curvine 能支持 `git clone`、数据库存储等复杂应用场景的关键，这类场景需要和本地磁盘完全一致的文件语义","locale":"zh-cn"},"5957":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-23","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#3-并发读写注意事项","content":"Curvine 支持多客户端并发读写同一个文件，但有明确特性：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5958":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-24","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#3-并发读写注意事项","content":"为了完整支持 POSIX 语义，Curvine 移除了写保护","locale":"zh-cn"},"5959":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-25","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#3-并发读写注意事项","content":"风险点：无写保护情况下，多客户端同时写入同一文件，可能出现数据覆盖、读到脏数据","locale":"zh-cn"},"5960":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-26","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#3-并发读写注意事项","content":"一句话总结差异：Curvine 一致性 = 本地磁盘语义，牺牲部分写保护，换并发、随机写能力；其他分布式存储 = 写保护 + Close-to-Open，牺牲可见性，换强一致","locale":"zh-cn"},"5961":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-27","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#三元数据缓存","content":"元数据：简单理解就是文件的“身份信息”，比如文件名、大小、权限、修改时间、文件/目录类型等，缓存元数据能大幅提升文件查询性能，Curvine 分为内核元数据缓存和客户端元数据缓存。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5962":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-28","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-内核元数据缓存","content":"Curvine 的 FUSE 客户端，可通过配置控制内核层面的元数据缓存，默认缓存 1 秒，显著提升查询效率。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5963":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-29","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-内核元数据缓存","content":"核心配置参数：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5964":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-30","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-内核元数据缓存","content":"| 配置项            | 默认值 | 作用                              |\n| -------------- | --- | ------------------------------- |\n| `attr_timeout` | 1 秒 | 文件属性缓存时间，加速 `getattr`（查询文件属性）操作 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"5965":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-31","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-内核元数据缓存","content":"| 配置项             | 默认值 | 作用                                |\n| --------------- | --- | --------------------------------- |\n| `entry_timeout` | 1 秒 | 文件/目录类型缓存时间，加速 `lookup`（查找文件路径）操作 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"5966":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-32","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-内核元数据缓存","content":"| 配置项                | 默认值     | 作用                      |\n| ------------------ | ------- | ----------------------- |\n| `negative_timeout` | 0 秒（禁用） | 不存在文件的查询失败缓存时间，避免重复无效请求 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"5967":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-33","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-内核元数据缓存","content":"缓存意义：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5968":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-34","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-内核元数据缓存","content":"访问路径如 `/a/b/c.log`，内核会依次查找 `/`、`/a`、`/a/b`、`/a/b/c.log`，无缓存需发起 4 次以上远程 RPC 请求；有缓存后直接从内核取数据，大量小文件场景下，性能提升极其明显，文件数据变化不频繁时，可适当调大缓存时间。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5969":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-35","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-内核元数据缓存","content":"核心特点：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5970":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-36","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-内核元数据缓存","content":"减少内核与用户态的切换，缓存命中时不访问 Curvine 用户态程序","locale":"zh-cn"},"5971":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-37","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-内核元数据缓存","content":"仅能加速 `lookup`、`getattr` 等少数接口，缓存内容有限","locale":"zh-cn"},"5972":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-38","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#2-客户端元数据缓存","content":"Curvine 自身开发的客户端级缓存，缓存内容比内核缓存更全面：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5973":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-39","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#2-客户端元数据缓存","content":"缓存完整文件属性、文件 block 块信息、目录下所有文件列表","locale":"zh-cn"},"5974":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-40","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#2-客户端元数据缓存","content":"优势：重复打开同一文件，无需访问元数据服务，大幅减少 RPC 远程调用","locale":"zh-cn"},"5975":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-41","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#2-客户端元数据缓存","content":"局限性：仅保证单客户端内数据一致。当前客户端新建文件，自身可立刻看到；其他客户端新建文件，需等本客户端缓存过期才能看到","locale":"zh-cn"},"5976":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-42","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#3-两种缓存对比与使用建议","content":"内核缓存：减少内核态切换，仅加速部分接口，全页缓存命中场景性能最优","locale":"zh-cn"},"5977":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-43","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#3-两种缓存对比与使用建议","content":"客户端缓存：缓存内容全，减少 RPC，但无法减少态切换","locale":"zh-cn"},"5978":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-44","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#3-两种缓存对比与使用建议","content":"使用方式：可单独用一种，也可搭配使用，根据业务场景灵活调整","locale":"zh-cn"},"5979":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-45","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-内核页缓存page-cache","content":"原理：内核会把已经读过的文件数据，缓存到内存页缓存中，重复读取时直接从内存取","locale":"zh-cn"},"5980":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-46","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-内核页缓存page-cache","content":"Curvine 优化：会跟踪已打开文件，文件被修改则页缓存自动失效，保证读到最新数据","locale":"zh-cn"},"5981":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-47","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-内核页缓存page-cache","content":"性能表现：重复读同一文件，延时低至微秒，吞吐量可达每秒几十 GiB，速度极快","locale":"zh-cn"},"5982":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-48","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-内核页缓存page-cache","content":"默认开启，内存不足时可配置 `direct_io = true` 关闭页缓存","locale":"zh-cn"},"5983":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-49","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#2-内核回写模式writeback-cache","content":"内核要求：Linux 内核 3.15 及以上支持，FUSE 专属特性","locale":"zh-cn"},"5984":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-50","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#2-内核回写模式writeback-cache","content":"原理：内核把大量小体积、高频随机写请求合并后再批量写入，减少 IO 次数，提升随机写性能","locale":"zh-cn"},"5985":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-51","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#2-内核回写模式writeback-cache","content":"副作用：会把顺序写转为随机写，严重降低顺序写入性能","locale":"zh-cn"},"5986":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-52","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#2-内核回写模式writeback-cache","content":"默认关闭，需手动配置开启，仅适合随机写多的场景，顺序写场景不建议开启","locale":"zh-cn"},"5987":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-53","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#五fuse-版本选择","content":"推荐配置：Linux 内核版本 5.0 及以上，比如 Ubuntu 22.04、Rocky Linux 9 等，能发挥 FUSE 最佳性能，异步、缓存特性完全适配","locale":"zh-cn"},"5988":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-54","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#五fuse-版本选择","content":"低内核风险：内核版本低于 4.15，FUSE 并发能力差、性能瓶颈明显，不建议生产环境使用","locale":"zh-cn"},"5989":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features","type":"page","content":"Key Features","breadcrumbs":["Documents","用户手册","核心特征"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features","locale":"zh-cn"},"5990":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","type":"page","content":"统一命名空间","breadcrumbs":["Documents","用户手册","核心特征"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","locale":"zh-cn"},"5991":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-0","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#一ufs-挂载","content":"一、UFS 挂载","locale":"zh-cn"},"5992":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-1","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#挂载","content":"二、挂载命令","locale":"zh-cn"},"5993":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-2","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#21-本地目录挂载测试","content":"2.1 本地目录挂载（测试）","locale":"zh-cn"},"5994":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-3","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#22-外部存储挂载","content":"2.2 外部存储挂载","locale":"zh-cn"},"5995":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-4","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#23-完整-mount-命令参数表","content":"2.3 完整 Mount 命令参数表","locale":"zh-cn"},"5996":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-5","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#三查看已有挂载点","content":"三、查看已有挂载点","locale":"zh-cn"},"5997":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-6","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#挂载模式","content":"四、两种挂载模式详解","locale":"zh-cn"},"5998":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-7","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"4.1 cache_mode（高性能读缓存）","locale":"zh-cn"},"5999":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-8","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"4.2 fs_mode（分层文件系统）","locale":"zh-cn"},"6000":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-9","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#五统一访问","content":"五、统一访问","locale":"zh-cn"},"6001":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-10","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#六空间释放","content":"六、空间释放","locale":"zh-cn"},"6002":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-11","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#七关闭统一访问","content":"七、关闭统一访问","locale":"zh-cn"},"6003":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-12","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#八总结","content":"八、总结","locale":"zh-cn"},"6004":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-13","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","content":"Curvine 提供 UFS（统一文件系统）视图来管理所有支持的分布式存储系统，包括本地文件系统、S3/MinIO、HDFS 等。简单来说，Curvine 的 UFS 挂载，就是做一个“路径映射”，帮你把各种五花八门的外部存储，统一整合到 Curvine 自己的文件系统里，不用再分别记不同存储的访问方式，实现一套接口访问所有存储。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6005":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-14","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#一ufs-挂载","content":"两个核心路径概念：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6006":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-15","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#一ufs-挂载","content":"UFS 路径：外部原始存储地址，必须带专属前缀（scheme），相当于存储的“原生家门牌号”。常见格式包括本地目录 `file://fs/cache_mode`、对象存储 S3/MinIO `s3://bucket/prefix`、大数据存储 HDFS `hdfs://nn/path`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6007":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-16","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#一ufs-挂载","content":"Curvine 路径（CV 路径）：集群内部统一的逻辑路径，固定以 `/` 开头，属于 Curvine 专属的 `cv://` 命名空间，在客户端里就是你能直接访问的挂载点目录，相当于给外部存储起了一个“集群内部通用小名”。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6008":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-17","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#一ufs-挂载","content":"挂载的核心价值：挂载完成后，不管底层是本地硬盘、S3 对象存储还是 HDFS，你都只用 Curvine 一套命令操作，完全不用关心底层存储的类型差异，大幅简化多存储访问成本。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6009":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-18","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#一ufs-挂载","content":"Curvine 将挂载表持久化到元数据中，因此 Curvine 重启时无需重新挂载。但必须遵循一些规则：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6010":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-19","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#一ufs-挂载","content":"不允许挂载到根路径。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6011":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-20","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#一ufs-挂载","content":"挂载路径下不允许挂载其他 UFS。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6012":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-21","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#一ufs-挂载","content":"相同的 Curvine 挂载路径不能挂载到不同的 UFS。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6013":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-22","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#挂载","content":"所有挂载命令都在 Curvine 安装目录下执行，基础命令格式固定：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6014":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-23","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#21-本地目录挂载测试","content":"适合本地测试、快速体验统一命名空间，不用连接外部存储，零配置上手。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6015":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-24","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#21-本地目录挂载测试","content":"命令解释：把本地 `file://fs/cache_mode` 目录挂载到 Curvine 内部 `/fs/cache_mode` 路径，读写模式选用缓存模式（`cache_mode`）。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6016":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-25","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#22-外部存储挂载","content":"对接 S3、OSS 这类对象存储时，需要额外配置连接地址、账号密码、地域等参数，替换成自己的存储信息即可使用。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6017":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-26","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#22-外部存储挂载","content":"参数说明（新手必填项）：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6018":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-27","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#22-外部存储挂载","content":"`s3.endpoint_url`：S3/MinIO 服务的访问地址","locale":"zh-cn"},"6019":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-28","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#22-外部存储挂载","content":"`s3.credentials.access` / `s3.credentials.secret`：存储的访问密钥（账号密码）","locale":"zh-cn"},"6020":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-29","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#22-外部存储挂载","content":"`s3.region_name`：存储所属地域，无特殊需求填 `cn` 即可","locale":"zh-cn"},"6021":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-30","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#22-外部存储挂载","content":"对于 `s3://...` 挂载，CLI 会自动从 URI 提取 `s3.bucket_name`；对于 `hdfs://...` 挂载，CLI 会自动推导 `hdfs.namenode` 与 `hdfs.root`。如果出现 Kerberos 配置但缺少 `hdfs.kerberos.ccache` 或 `KRB5CCNAME`，CLI 会给出警告。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6022":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-31","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#23-完整-mount-命令参数表","content":"| 参数名称       | 默认值 | 含义                                                                |\n| ---------- | --- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `ufs_path` | 无   | 外部底层存储 URI 路径，必须带 scheme 前缀（`s3://`、`oss://`、`file://`），无前缀命令执行失败 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6023":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-32","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#23-完整-mount-命令参数表","content":"| 参数名称      | 默认值 | 含义                                          |\n| --------- | --- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| `cv_path` | 无   | Curvine 内部逻辑挂载路径，必须以 `/` 开头，仅支持绝对路径，不支持相对路径 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6024":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-33","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#23-完整-mount-命令参数表","content":"| 参数名称           | 默认值       | 含义                                                            |\n| -------------- | --------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `--write-type` | `fs_mode` | 挂载写入模式，必填核心参数，仅支持 `cache_mode`（缓存加速模式）、`fs_mode`（完整 POSIX 模式） |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6025":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-34","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#23-完整-mount-命令参数表","content":"| 参数名称       | 默认值     | 含义                                                                        |\n| ---------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `--update` | `false` | 开关型 flag 参数，挂载点已存在时用于更新配置，挂载路径（`ufs_path` + `cv_path`）不可修改，未传该参数重复挂载会直接报错 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6026":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-35","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#23-完整-mount-命令参数表","content":"| 参数名称                   | 默认值    | 含义                                                                 |\n| ---------------------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `--check-path-consist` | `true` | 布尔值，新建挂载时校验 UFS 路径与 CV 路径 path 部分一致，方便运维对应；设为 `false` 可允许两者路径形状不一致 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6027":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-36","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#23-完整-mount-命令参数表","content":"| 参数名称                | 默认值     | 含义                                                                                          |\n| ------------------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `--read-verify-ufs` | `false` | 布尔值，仅 `cache_mode` 生效，设为 `true` 时，读取缓存前比对 UFS 文件 `mtime`（修改时间）和文件大小，不一致则判定缓存失效，重新从 UFS 读取数据 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6028":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-37","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#23-完整-mount-命令参数表","content":"| 参数名称       | 默认值  | 含义                                                                             |\n| ---------- | ---- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `--ttl-ms` | `7d` | 挂载点数据缓存过期时间，支持人性化时间单位：`7d`（7 天）、`1h`（1 小时）、`30m`（30 分钟）、`100s`（100 秒），无需手动换算毫秒 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6029":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-38","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#23-完整-mount-命令参数表","content":"| 参数名称         | 默认值 | 含义                                   |\n| ------------ | --- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `--replicas` | 无   | 整数类型，文件副本数配置，未设置时，创建文件自动回退至客户端默认副本配置 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6030":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-39","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#23-完整-mount-命令参数表","content":"| 参数名称           | 默认值 | 含义                                 |\n| -------------- | --- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `--block-size` | 无   | 文件数据块大小配置，未设置时，创建文件自动回退至客户端默认块大小配置 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6031":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-40","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#23-完整-mount-命令参数表","content":"| 参数名称                      | 默认值 | 含义                                                    |\n| ------------------------- | --- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| `--storage-type`（简写 `-s`） | 无   | Curvine 本地存储介质类型，可选 `mem`（内存）、`ssd`（固态硬盘）、`hdd`（机械硬盘） |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6032":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-41","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#23-完整-mount-命令参数表","content":"| 参数名称         | 默认值                 | 含义                                                                        |\n| ------------ | ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `--provider` | 未设置（底层默认 `opendal`） | UFS 底层实现方式选择，可选 `auto`（自动识别）、`oss-hdfs`、`opendal`，默认 `opendal` 适配绝大多数存储类型 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6033":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-42","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#23-完整-mount-命令参数表","content":"完整可复制挂载命令模板：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6034":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-43","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#三查看已有挂载点","content":"挂载完成后，想查看集群里所有已配置的挂载点，不用记复杂参数，直接执行极简命令：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6035":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-44","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#三查看已有挂载点","content":"示例输出：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6036":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-45","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#三查看已有挂载点","content":"`ID`：挂载点唯一标识，系统自动生成","locale":"zh-cn"},"6037":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-46","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#三查看已有挂载点","content":"`Curvine Path` / `UFS Path`：对应内部、外部路径，核对是否和自己配置一致","locale":"zh-cn"},"6038":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-47","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#三查看已有挂载点","content":"`Write Type`：核心读写模式（`cache_mode` / `fs_mode`）","locale":"zh-cn"},"6039":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-48","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#三查看已有挂载点","content":"`TTL Action`：缓存过期处理策略","locale":"zh-cn"},"6040":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-49","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"核心定位：给外部存储做缓存加速，目录结构和原始数据以外部 UFS 存储为准，Curvine 只做缓存层，提升读取速度。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6041":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-50","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"核心运行逻辑：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6042":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-51","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"目录查询（list）、修改操作：直接查外部 UFS，保证视图最新","locale":"zh-cn"},"6043":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-52","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"文件属性查询（getattr）：先查 Curvine 缓存，缓存有效直接返回，无效再回查 UFS","locale":"zh-cn"},"6044":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-53","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"固定过期策略：`ttl_action=delete`，缓存到期后，Curvine 里的文件和目录会自动彻底删除，只保留外部 UFS 数据","locale":"zh-cn"},"6045":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-54","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"读操作：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6046":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-55","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"缓存未命中：直接读外部 UFS，同时异步后台把数据加载到 Curvine 缓存，下次读取直接走缓存，速度更快","locale":"zh-cn"},"6047":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-56","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"缓存已命中：直接读 Curvine 缓存，不用访问 UFS","locale":"zh-cn"},"6048":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-57","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"风险提示：缓存有效期内，若外部 UFS 数据被其他工具修改，Curvine 缓存不会自动更新，会读到过期数据","locale":"zh-cn"},"6049":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-58","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"解决办法：数据更新频繁的场景，挂载时加参数 `--read-verify-ufs=true`，每次读取前比对 UFS 文件修改时间和大小，不一致就重新拉取，代价是多一次 UFS 查询，读取速度稍慢","locale":"zh-cn"},"6050":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-59","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"写操作：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6051":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-60","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"写操作直接穿透到外部 UFS，Curvine 缓存同步失效","locale":"zh-cn"},"6052":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-61","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"删除文件会直接删除 UFS 里的原始数据，不是只删缓存，操作需谨慎","locale":"zh-cn"},"6053":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-62","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"能力边界与限制：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6054":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-63","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"POSIX 文件语义完全依赖外部 UFS 支持，UFS 不支持的操作（比如软链接、文件锁）会直接报错","locale":"zh-cn"},"6055":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-64","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"部分高级操作（修改文件属性、软链接、文件锁）受限，以当前版本和 UFS 能力为准","locale":"zh-cn"},"6056":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-65","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"缓存失效条件：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6057":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-66","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"缓存达到 TTL 过期时间，自动失效","locale":"zh-cn"},"6058":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-67","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"通过 Curvine 执行写入、修改、删除操作，缓存主动失效","locale":"zh-cn"},"6059":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-68","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"开启 `--read-verify-ufs` 后，UFS 文件修改时间/大小和 Curvine 记录不一致，缓存失效","locale":"zh-cn"},"6060":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-69","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"核心定位：脱离 UFS 语义限制，提供完整的 POSIX 文件系统能力，所有操作先在 Curvine 内部完成，再异步同步到外部 UFS，适合需要标准文件操作的业务场景。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6061":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-70","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"核心运行逻辑：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6062":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-71","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"所有数据操作先经过 Curvine，不走客户端直写 UFS，和未挂载外部存储的普通 Curvine 目录用法完全一致","locale":"zh-cn"},"6063":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-72","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"操作日志通过 Raft 协议同步到所有 Master 节点，由 Leader 节点统一回放，同步到外部 UFS，保证 Curvine 和 UFS 数据最终一致","locale":"zh-cn"},"6064":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-73","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"核心操作与 UFS 同步规则：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6065":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-74","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"| 操作类型          | 同步到 UFS 的具体行为                 |\n| ------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| 创建目录（`mkdir`） | Leader Master 自动访问 UFS，创建对应目录 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6066":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-75","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"| 操作类型              | 同步到 UFS 的具体行为                 |\n| ----------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| 删除文件/目录（`delete`） | Leader Master 自动删除 UFS 对应路径数据 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6067":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-76","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"| 操作类型               | 同步到 UFS 的具体行为                  |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------------ |\n| 文件写入完成（`complete`） | 启动数据同步任务，把 Curvine 里的文件拷贝到 UFS |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6068":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-77","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"| 操作类型          | 同步到 UFS 的具体行为                                          |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 重命名（`rename`） | UFS 支持 rename：直接执行；UFS 不支持（如 S3/OSS）：删除源路径，全量拷贝数据到目标路径 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6069":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-78","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"S3、OSS 这类对象存储不支持 rename 操作，严禁对大目录执行 rename！会触发全量数据拷贝，耗时极长、阻塞后续操作，还会产生大量存储和带宽成本。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6070":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-79","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"元数据同步：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6071":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-80","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"`fs_mode` 下，Curvine 不会自动感知外部 UFS 的数据变化，如果直接在 S3/HDFS 后台修改、新增、删除文件，Curvine 目录不会更新。需要手动执行元数据对齐命令：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6072":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-81","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"替换路径为自己的 Curvine 挂载路径即可，生产环境建议定期执行或变更后手动执行。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6073":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-82","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"数据过期规则：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6074":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-83","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"数据过期后：只清理 Curvine 里的实际数据，元数据保留，外部 UFS 数据不受影响","locale":"zh-cn"},"6075":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-84","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"再次读取：自动从 UFS 把数据加载回 Curvine，正常访问","locale":"zh-cn"},"6076":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-85","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"过期后写入：核心原因是绝大多数 UFS（尤其是 S3、OSS、对象存储类）不支持随机写、文件空洞、增量修改等标准 POSIX 文件特性，无法直接在 UFS 底层完成写入操作，因此系统会先自动把 UFS 里的原始数据完整拷贝回 Curvine，再基于 Curvine 完成写入修改，大文件拷贝会产生一定耗时，属于正常机制，并非系统异常","locale":"zh-cn"},"6077":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-86","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#五统一访问","content":"UFS 挂载后，Curvine 提供了一个统一的文件系统视图，客户端、命令行工具、FUSE、API 都可以通过统一的 Curvine 路径访问 UFS 文件系统。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6078":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-87","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#五统一访问","content":"如果使用 `cv` 命令，可以通过 `--cache-only` 临时关闭统一访问，只查看已缓存在 Curvine 中的文件。详见 CLI 页面。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6079":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-88","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#六空间释放","content":"`cache_mode` 下删除文件会直接删 UFS 原始数据，如果你只想释放 Curvine 本地缓存空间、保留 UFS 原始数据和元数据，用 `free` 命令，绝对安全，不会误删不符合条件的数据。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6080":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-89","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#六空间释放","content":"`-r`：递归清理目录下所有符合条件的缓存","locale":"zh-cn"},"6081":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-90","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#六空间释放","content":"适用范围：`fs_mode`、`cache_mode`、未挂载 UFS 的普通目录都能用","locale":"zh-cn"},"6082":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-91","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#六空间释放","content":"安全保障：不符合清理条件的文件自动跳过（比如无 TTL、未同步到 UFS 的数据）","locale":"zh-cn"},"6083":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-92","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#六空间释放","content":"清理条件：文件同时存在于 Curvine 和 UFS，且 `ttl_action != none`","locale":"zh-cn"},"6084":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-93","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#七关闭统一访问","content":"如果您不想使用统一访问，可以添加、修改如下配置：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6085":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-94","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#八总结","content":"先明确场景：读多选 `cache_mode`，写多选 `fs_mode`","locale":"zh-cn"},"6086":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-95","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#八总结","con