Manuals/Operations/cli-33","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#原生-clicv","content":"**约定：**","locale":"zh-cn"},"6125":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-34","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#原生-clicv","content":"生产环境将发行包的 `bin/` 加入 `PATH` 后，直接使用 `cv`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6126":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-35","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#原生-clicv","content":"通过 `cargo run -p curvine-cli -- ...` 运行时，帮助中的程序名会显示为 `curvine-cli`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6127":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-36","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#原生-clicv","content":"本文中的 `<PATH>`、`<JOB_ID>` 等为位置参数；`[OPTION]` 表示可选项。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6128":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-37","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#1-report查看集群状态","content":"**用法：** `cv report [json|all|capacity|used|available]`","locale":"zh-cn"},"6129":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-38","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#1-report查看集群状态","content":"| 命令          | 说明                                                 |\n| ----------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `cv report` | 默认概览，包含 active master、容量、inode/block 数和 worker 列表。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6130":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-39","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#1-report查看集群状态","content":"| 命令               | 说明              