toring#worker-指标","content":"| 指标名称       | 描述       |\n| ---------- | -------- |\n| num_blocks | block 总数 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"6362":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring-59","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring#worker-指标","content":"| 指标名称                 | 描述          |\n| -------------------- | ----------- |\n| num_blocks_to_delete | 待删除 block 数 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"6363":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring-60","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring#worker-指标","content":"| 指标名称              | 描述      |\n| ----------------- | ------- |\n| used_memory_bytes | 已用内存字节数 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"6364":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes","type":"page","content":"发布说明与已知不兼容版本","breadcrumbs":["Documents","用户手册","运维管理"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes","locale":"zh-cn"},"6365":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes-0","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes#发布说明模板","content":"发布说明模板","locale":"zh-cn"},"6366":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes-1","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes#已知不兼容版本","content":"已知不兼容版本","locale":"zh-cn"},"6367":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes-2","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes#版本特定不兼容","content":"版本特定不兼容","locale":"zh-cn"},"6368":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes-3","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes#上报新的不兼容","content":"上报新的不兼容","locale":"zh-cn"},"6369":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes-4","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes","content":"本页汇总 Curvine 每次发布使用的发布说明模板，以及已知与其他 Curvine 组件不兼容的发布版本清单。每当有版本加入 `master.compatibility.blocked_versions` 或引入新的协议版本时，请同步更新本页。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6370":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes-5","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes#发布说明模板","content":"复制下面的模板，填入版本号和日期，随发布公告一起发布。**兼容性**表必须与版本管理与兼容性中该版本的兼容矩阵一致。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6371":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes-6","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes#已知不兼容版本","content":"当某些版本存在关键缺陷或协议级不兼容，导致在混合版本集群中不安全时，会被加入本清单。master `compatibility` 配置中的 `blocked_versions` 是这些条目的运维强制执行手段：被列为 blocked 的版本**无论模式如何都总是被拒绝**（紧急兜底）。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6372":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes-7","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes#已知不兼容版本","content":"| 版本    | 组件     | 原因                       | 引入版本  | 解决方案                |\n| ----- | ------ | ------------------------ | ----- | ------------------- |\n| 0.2.5 | worker | batch-write 路径存在严重数据损坏缺陷 | 0.2.5 | 升级到 0.2.6+ 或 0.3.0+ |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6373":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes-8","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes#版本特定不兼容","content":"**0.3.x 旧版 worker / client 对接 0.4.x master。** 运行 0.3.x（或更早）的 worker 和 client 不上报结构化 `component_info`。master 将其识别为旧版 peer：`diagnose` 模式（默认）下允许并告警，仅在 `enforce` 模式下拒绝。不会发生数据丢失或协议错误，master 只是无法校验它们的协议版本、发布版本或能力。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6374":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes-9","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes#版本特定不兼容","content":"**预发布 vs 发布版本边界。** 预发布版本排在正式版本之前（`0.4.0-alpha < 0.4.0`）。如果配置了 `min_worker_version = \"0.4.0\"`，预发布 worker 会因低于边界而被拒绝。如需允许预发布版本，请相应调低最低版本。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6375":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes-10","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes#上报新的不兼容","content":"打开 GitHub issue 并打上 **compatibility** 标签。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6376":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes-11","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes#上报新的不兼容","content":"附带：master 版本、worker/client 版本、各组件的协议版本、完整的兼容性错误或告警，以及复现步骤。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6377":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes-12","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes#上报新的不兼容","content":"Curvine 团队评估后，要么将版本加入 `blocked_versions`，要么在本页记录该不兼容。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6378":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","type":"page","content":"版本管理与兼容性","breadcrumbs":["Documents","用户手册","运维管理"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","locale":"zh-cn"},"6379":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-0","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"u