/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#worker--client数据面","content":"Worker ↔ Client（数据面）","locale":"zh-cn"},"6387":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-8","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#强制策略","content":"强制策略","locale":"zh-cn"},"6388":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-9","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#能力capabilities","content":"能力（Capabilities）","locale":"zh-cn"},"6389":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-10","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#可观测性","content":"可观测性","locale":"zh-cn"},"6390":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-11","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#发布说明与已知不兼容","content":"发布说明与已知不兼容","locale":"zh-cn"},"6391":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-12","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","content":"本章介绍 Curvine 各组件的版本自描述机制，以及如何运维一个组件版本不完全一致的集群。自 0.4.x 起，每个二进制都会输出结构化版本信息，服务端会广播兼容性契约，master 以默认 `diagnose`（宽松）策略对 peer 进行评估。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6392":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-13","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#版本格式","content":"所有 Curvine 组件使用统一的版本格式：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6393":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-14","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-