,"tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#查看组件版本","content":"输出示例：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6400":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-21","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#查看组件版本","content":"字段含义：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6401":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-22","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#查看组件版本","content":"`component` — 组件名称（`master`、`worker`、`client`、`fuse`、`cli`、`csi`）。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6402":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-23","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#查看组件版本","content":"`release_version` — Cargo/包版本。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6403":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-24","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#查看组件版本","content":"`git_commit` / `git_tag` / `git_branch` — 精确的源码来源信息。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6404":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-25","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#查看组件版本","content":"`protocol_version` / `min_protocol_version` — 线上协议范围。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6405":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-26","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#查看组件版本","content":"`capabilities` — 特性级协商令牌。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6406":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-27","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#查看-worker-版本统计","content":"CLI 可以汇总所有在线 worker 的版本分布，快速判断集群是运行同构版本还是包含新旧混合版本：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6407":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-28","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#查看-worker-版本统计","content":"输出示例：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6408":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-29","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#查看-worker-版本统计","content":"上报结构化 `component_info` 的 worker 按其 `release_version` 统计；仅上报旧版 `software_version` 字符串的 worker 按 `legacy (<版本>)` 统计；完全没有版本数据的 worker 归入 `legacy (no version)`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6409":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-30","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#组件间兼容性","content":"master 会对每个 worker 心跳和客户端握手执行兼容性评估。默认行为是**宽松**的：在未显式配置的情况下，master 记录警告并允许请求，因此旧组件不会仅仅因为它们不包含结构化版本协议而被拒绝。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6410":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-31","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#master--worker","content":"| Master | Worker | 协议  | 默认行为 |\n| ------ | ------ | --- | ---- |\n| 0.4.x  | 0.4.x  | 1   | ✅ 兼容 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6411":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-32","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#master--worker","content":"| Master | Worker                       | 协议  | 默认行为                              |\n| ------ | ---------------------------- | --- | --------------------------------- |\n| 0.4.x  | 0.3.x（旧版，无 `component_info`） | 无   | ⚠️ `diagnose` 下告警；仅 `enforce` 下拒绝 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6412":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-33","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#master--worker","content":"| Master | Worker                  | 协议  | 默认行为                              |\n| ------ | ----------------------- | --- | --------------------------------- |\n| 0.4.x  | 低于 `min_worker_version` | 无   | ⚠️ `diagnose` 下告警；仅 `enforce` 下拒绝 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6413":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-34","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#master--client含-fuse--cli--csi","content":"| Master | Client | 协议  | 默认行为 |\n| ------ | ------ | --- | ---- |\n| 0.4.x  | 0.4.x  | 1   | ✅ 兼容 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-2"},"6414":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-35","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#master--client含-fuse--cli--csi","content":"| Master | Client    | 协议  | 默认行为                              |\n| ------ | --------- | --- | --------------------------------- |\n| 0.4.x  | 0.3.x（旧版） | 无   | ⚠️ `diagnose` 下告警；仅 `enforce` 下拒绝 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-2"},"6415":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-36","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#worker--client数据面","content":"| Worker | Client | 协议  | 默认行为 |\n| ------ | ------ | --- | ---- |\n| 0.4.x  | 0.4.x  | 1   | ✅ 兼容 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-3"},"6416":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-37","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#worker--client数据面","content":"| Worker | Client    | 协议  | 默认行为                              |\n| ------ | --------- | --- | --------------------------------- |\n| 0.4.x  | 0.3.x（旧版） | 无   | ⚠️ `diagnose` 下告警；仅 `enforce` 下拒绝 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-3"},"6417":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-38","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#强制策略","content":"兼容性策略在 master 配置文件中配置：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6418":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-39","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#强制策略","content":"**`mode = \"diagnose\"`（默认）：** 不兼容的 peer 被允许，master 记录告警，内容包括 peer、其版本和期望的边界。这是安全默认值，不会破坏已有的混合版本集群。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6419":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-40","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#强制策略","content":"**`mode = \"enforce\"`：** 不兼容的 peer 被拒绝，错误信息包含实际 peer 版本和升级建议。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6420":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-41","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#强制策略","content":"**`blocked_versions`：** 列出的版本无论模式如何都**总是被拒绝**。这是针对已知问题版本的紧急兜底手段（见发布说明页的已知不兼容清单）。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6421":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-42","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#能力capabilities","content":"除版本外，功能还通过能力令牌协商：每个组件在其 `ComponentVersion` 中声明能力，只有**双方**都声明某能力时该特性才启用。因此在新发布中引入的能力会静默禁用，直到整个数据链路都升级。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6422":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-43","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#能力capabilities","content":"| 能力         | 说明           | 引入版本  |\n| ---------- | ------------ | ----- |\n| `transfer` | Worker 间数据传输 | 0.4.0 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"6423":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-44","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#能力capabilities","content":"| 能力            | 说明     | 引入版本  |\n| ------------- | ------ | ----- |\n| `batch-write` | 批量写入优化 | 0.4.0 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"6424":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-45","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#能力capabilities","content":"| 能力              | 说明                   | 引入版本  |\n| --------------- | -------------------- | ----- |\n| `short-circuit` | 短路读（客户端 → Worker 直连） | 0.4.0 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"6425":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-46","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#可观测性","content":"master 在 Prometheus 端点（`http://<master>:9001/metrics`）暴露兼容性指标，完整指标表见监控指标。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6426":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-47","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#可观测性","content":"| 指标                      | 类型    | 标签                    | 说明                    |\n| ----------------------- | ----- | --------------------- | --------------------- |\n| `compat_worker_verdict` | Gauge | `worker_id`、`verdict` | 每个 worker 当前兼容性结论，为 1 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-5"},"6427":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-48","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#可观测性","content":"| 指标                      | 类型    | 标签                      | 说明                    |\n| ----------------------- | ----- | ----------------------- | --------------------- |\n| `compat_client_verdict` | Gauge | `client_addr`、`verdict` | 每个 client 当前兼容性结论，为 1 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-5"},"6428":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-49","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#可观测性","content":"| 指标                              | 类型      | 标签                    | 说明                |\n| ------------------------------- | ------- | --------------------- | ----------------- |\n| `compat_enforce_rejected_total` | Counter | `component`、`verdict` | enforce 模式下累计拒绝次数 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-5"},"6429":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-50","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#可观测性","content":"`verdict` 取值：`compatible`、`missing_info`、`blocked`、`protocol_mismatch`、`version_too_old`、`version_unknown`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6430":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-51","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/ve