oint                     | Port |\n| --------- | ---------------------------- | ---- |\n| Master    | `http://<host>:9001/metrics` | 9001 |"],[3277,"| Component | Endpoint                     | Port |\n| --------- | ---------------------------- | ---- |\n| Worker    | `http://<host>:9002/metrics` | 9002 |"],[6639,"| Component | Endpoint                     | Port |\n| --------- | ---------------------------- | ---- |\n| Worker    | `http://<host>:9002/metrics` | 9002 |"],[1763,"| Component | Required change | Notes                                                                                                                      |\n| --------- | --------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Master    | None.           | The Master does not need a configuration change; clients that disable Transfer keep using the legacy Load and Export RPCs. |"],[1764,"| Component | Required change | Notes                                                                                            |\n| --------- | --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| Worker    | None.           | Workers need a version that supports Transfer tasks. Report endpoints are included in each task. |"],[204,"| Component | Responsibility                                                                |\n| --------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Raft**  | Replicate journal entries; leader election and failover; RocksDB log storage. |"],[2381,"| Component | Type      | Description |\n| --------- | --------- | ----------- |\n| CSI Node  | DaemonSet | Node mount  |"],[696,"| Component | Wrapper command                 | Effective binary                                                  |\n| --------- | ------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------